{"id":1579,"title":"哈希算法介绍","summary":"哈希表介绍","tags":"","components":[{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"a8147fcb-0299-355c-978e-6b6318b59a82","knowledge_id":585,"title":"哈希表介绍","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":0,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":585,"title":"哈希表介绍","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"ca090622-a3c5-3792-b511-e73f048e52ee","title":"","title_html":"","text":"**哈希**是将文本、数字、文件或其他任何数据（通常称为键）转换为哈希值的过程。","text_html":"<p><strong>哈希</strong>是将文本、数字、文件或其他任何数据（通常称为键）转换为哈希值的过程。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"6106aac8-02e9-3867-b37a-ddf1e18dc5ce","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/639590c18cc394e10db7.png","style":"original","caption":"Hashing","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":1308,"height":496,"size_in_bytes":25164,"name":"dsa-8.1.1.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":1}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"aa589c98-0954-3267-b80a-eafd7a28cda0","knowledge_id":586,"title":"哈希表","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":1,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":586,"title":"哈希表","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"ad1138d2-6ce6-31f6-9582-92f1516d0f35","title":"","title_html":"","text":"**哈希表**是用于**存储键值对**(`key-value`)的结构化表格。","text_html":"<p><strong>哈希表</strong>是用于<strong>存储键值对</strong>(<code>key-value</code>)的结构化表格。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"f0704ab6-2a9e-3261-9d5c-f90a03a6325d","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/67d646a22bd6841e4fc8.png","style":"original","caption":"Key-value pair","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":1308,"height":524,"size_in_bytes":17565,"name":"dsa-8.1.2.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"19f278e7-bc9b-3b94-978f-cbaf37900094","title":"","title_html":"","text":"哈希表数据结构以键值对的形式存储元素，其中：\n\n- `key` - 哈希key，如对文本、数字哈希后对应的数字或字符串\n- `value` - 与key相关的值，一般为字符串或数字\n\n让我们来看看一个空的哈希表。","text_html":"<p>哈希表数据结构以键值对的形式存储元素，其中：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>key</code> - 哈希key，如对文本、数字哈希后对应的数字或字符串</li>\n<li><code>value</code> - 与key相关的值，一般为字符串或数字</li>\n</ul>\n<p>让我们来看看一个空的哈希表。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"fdfd717c-2eef-3c9d-9184-6379325958cd","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/b720ae94df70e2378cd1.png","style":"original","caption":"Empty Hash Table","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":1308,"height":1018,"size_in_bytes":11626,"name":"dsa-8.1.3.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":3},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"78abb971-c95f-3073-8457-c0ffa06a73c1","title":"","title_html":"","text":"这是一个大小为 **5** 的空哈希表。\n\n存储键值对的位置称为槽（`slot`）。","text_html":"<p>这是一个大小为 <strong>5</strong> 的空哈希表。</p>\n<p>存储键值对的位置称为槽（<code>slot</code>）。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":4}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"870f4183-0bbe-3c50-ba03-04cbff730fa2","knowledge_id":587,"title":"哈希函数","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":2,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":587,"title":"哈希函数","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"db2428d1-362f-357f-a3fb-f2c670fddc80","title":"","title_html":"","text":"用于将键(`key`)转换为哈希值(`value`)的函数称为哈希函数。\n通过哈希哈希，将每一项和槽之间建立映射关系。\n\n哈希函数的写法一般如下：","text_html":"<p>用于将键(<code>key</code>)转换为哈希值(<code>value</code>)的函数称为哈希函数。\n通过哈希哈希，将每一项和槽之间建立映射关系。</p>\n<p>哈希函数的写法一般如下：</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"d9d9df31-4c1e-3072-9ef1-c5039f27bc8b","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"H(x) = f(x)","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":false,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"e0fda392-f5ba-378a-be7e-fbe98388356a","title":"","title_html":"","text":"在这里，\n\n- `H(x)`是哈希函数\n- `x` 是键\n- `f(x)`是哈希值","text_html":"<p>在这里，</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>H(x)</code>是哈希函数</li>\n<li><code>x</code> 是键</li>\n<li><code>f(x)</code>是哈希值</li>\n</ul>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"e191c69d-76b0-3724-a804-d149f9a272df","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/328eb0103693b99c313e.png","style":"original","caption":"A hash function","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":1308,"height":620,"size_in_bytes":41926,"name":"dsa-8.1.4.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":3}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"8a80e5b0-b5aa-3104-a4b2-3f81df282c7f","knowledge_id":588,"title":"示例 1：哈希","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":3,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":588,"title":"示例 1：哈希","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"e3a5542f-f909-3b1a-ae98-365ce1384fa1","title":"","title_html":"","text":"请看下面的例子：","text_html":"<p>请看下面的例子：</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"357aed7a-767b-37c7-985c-9ae7355ddf97","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/ee643788e82b97e50dbe.png","style":"original","caption":"Each Item Is Mapped to Its Respective Slot","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":1306,"height":1018,"size_in_bytes":16362,"name":"dsa-8.1.5.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"43dd44dd-149a-3c8f-ad30-696702f99420","title":"","title_html":"","text":"在这个例子中，每一项被映射到各自的槽中。这种映射称为哈希。\n\n这样的表叫做哈希表。\n\n这里哈希函数是 `H(x) = x`。这意味着每个键都被映射到与键相等的位置上。","text_html":"<p>在这个例子中，每一项被映射到各自的槽中。这种映射称为哈希。</p>\n<p>这样的表叫做哈希表。</p>\n<p>这里哈希函数是 <code>H(x) = x</code>。这意味着每个键都被映射到与键相等的位置上。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"242cb1ac-c9cf-3298-ab93-218071009913","knowledge_id":589,"title":"示例 2：哈希","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":4,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":589,"title":"示例 2：哈希","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"5991ae38-9a54-3ed9-aa62-4a05050aff8a","title":"","title_html":"","text":"让我们再看一另外一个哈希表：","text_html":"<p>让我们再看一另外一个哈希表：</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"f3e2bfeb-e630-3980-aeda-dc07bd3ca1c6","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/f1b20fae8c9c5feabd92.png","style":"original","caption":"Key-Value Mapping by Alphabetic Position of First Letter","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":1308,"height":924,"size_in_bytes":20792,"name":"dsa-8.1.6.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"4fdf244b-5849-3e75-99f4-405d7734d519","title":"","title_html":"","text":"在此示例中，每个键（字符串）都被映射为一个值（数字），该值等于其第一个字母的字母顺序。\n\n这里的哈希函数是 `H(x) = ASCII(x[0]) - 64`。","text_html":"<p>在此示例中，每个键（字符串）都被映射为一个值（数字），该值等于其第一个字母的字母顺序。</p>\n<p>这里的哈希函数是 <code>H(x) = ASCII(x[0]) - 64</code>。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"899eee8a-684b-3d49-90a3-fc4e4c904126","knowledge_id":590,"title":"为什么要进行哈希搜索？","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":5,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":590,"title":"为什么要进行哈希搜索？","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"ffb34e72-739b-399a-8401-007c9e40e5df","title":"","title_html":"","text":"在讨论哈希作为一种搜索算法之前，我们先来看看其他搜索算法。\n\n在线性查找中，查找列表的一个元素平均需要花费 `O(n)` 时间。二分查找是一种改进，平均耗时为 `O(log n)`(依赖列表有序)。\n\n**但它还能更快吗？**\n\n让我们看一下这个数据集，假设需要搜索**5**。","text_html":"<p>在讨论哈希作为一种搜索算法之前，我们先来看看其他搜索算法。</p>\n<p>在线性查找中，查找列表的一个元素平均需要花费 <code>O(n)</code> 时间。二分查找是一种改进，平均耗时为 <code>O(log n)</code>(依赖列表有序)。</p>\n<p><strong>但它还能更快吗？</strong></p>\n<p>让我们看一下这个数据集，假设需要搜索<strong>5</strong>。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"1e38a282-411c-38b6-b4fa-49639bad6c2c","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"2, 4, 7, 9, 3, 5, 1","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":false,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"faa43901-5a17-31d9-b14d-2e99b1b668a3","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/e3829d24b44ddb277215.png","style":"original","caption":"A Random Dataset","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":1308,"height":260,"size_in_bytes":5674,"name":"dsa-8.1.7.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":2},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"b3dcd87c-8c92-397e-bcd8-dfdf456c8f45","title":"","title_html":"","text":"无论是线性查找还是二分查找，对于大型列表都不够理想。\n\n现在，想象一下这些数据排列在哈希表中的情形：","text_html":"<p>无论是线性查找还是二分查找，对于大型列表都不够理想。</p>\n<p>现在，想象一下这些数据排列在哈希表中的情形：</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":3},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"5e164cc2-9d28-3021-be25-613040eabf83","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/a0660301a67110791224.png","style":"original","caption":"Items in a Hash Table","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":1306,"height":1018,"size_in_bytes":16362,"name":"dsa-8.1.8.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":4},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"cd70d43c-f979-3b0d-ac50-36de338f4c30","title":"","title_html":"","text":"要找到**5**，只需查看哈希表第**5**位就可以了！\n\n这就实现了恒定的时间复杂度，表示为 `O(1)`。\n\n哈希就像是搜索技术中的超级英雄。它不在乎顺序，可以在眨眼间发现项目。\n\n这就是为什么哈希技术被用于查找计算机程序中的内容或海量数据库的原因。","text_html":"<p>要找到<strong>5</strong>，只需查看哈希表第<strong>5</strong>位就可以了！</p>\n<p>这就实现了恒定的时间复杂度，表示为 <code>O(1)</code>。</p>\n<p>哈希就像是搜索技术中的超级英雄。它不在乎顺序，可以在眨眼间发现项目。</p>\n<p>这就是为什么哈希技术被用于查找计算机程序中的内容或海量数据库的原因。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":5}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"5e929681-5290-317a-8b20-e776addd94e0","knowledge_id":591,"title":"为什么使用哈希进行安全加密？","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":6,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":591,"title":"为什么使用哈希进行安全加密？","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"40f1577d-72e0-370a-a055-39b707cdf14d","title":"","title_html":"","text":"想象你正在建造一个高度机密的保险库，进入保险库需要输入密码。你的目标是保护这些密码。\n\n假设你有进入保险库的人员名单及其密码：\n\n| 用户名     | 密码        |\n|---------|-----------|\n| Alice   | sunflower |\n| Bob     | chocolate |\n| Charlie | sunflower |\n\n通过哈希函数，将用户密码进行加密，，如下：\n\n| 用户名     | 密码                    |\n|---------|-----------------------|\n| Alice   | hashed puzzle piece 1 |\n| Bob     | hashed puzzle piece 2 |\n| Charlie | hashed puzzle piece 1 |\n\n当用户输入密码时，将哈希函数应用到输入密码上，并与数据库中存储的加密密码行比较。如果匹配，则密码正确。\n\n如果入侵者以某种方式获取了加密密码，那么破译原始密码就是一个巨大的挑战。他们无法将机密字符串转换成原始密码。哈希算法不仅在密码验证方面表现出色，在密码保存方面也是如此。\n\n因此，哈希技术被广泛应用于安全领域。","text_html":"<p>想象你正在建造一个高度机密的保险库，进入保险库需要输入密码。你的目标是保护这些密码。</p>\n<p>假设你有进入保险库的人员名单及其密码：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">用户名</th>\n<th align=\"left\">密码</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">Alice</td>\n<td align=\"left\">sunflower</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">Bob</td>\n<td align=\"left\">chocolate</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">Charlie</td>\n<td align=\"left\">sunflower</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>通过哈希函数，将用户密码进行加密，，如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">用户名</th>\n<th align=\"left\">密码</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">Alice</td>\n<td align=\"left\">hashed puzzle piece 1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">Bob</td>\n<td align=\"left\">hashed puzzle piece 2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">Charlie</td>\n<td align=\"left\">hashed puzzle piece 1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>当用户输入密码时，将哈希函数应用到输入密码上，并与数据库中存储的加密密码行比较。如果匹配，则密码正确。</p>\n<p>如果入侵者以某种方式获取了加密密码，那么破译原始密码就是一个巨大的挑战。他们无法将机密字符串转换成原始密码。哈希算法不仅在密码验证方面表现出色，在密码保存方面也是如此。</p>\n<p>因此，哈希技术被广泛应用于安全领域。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0}]}},{"type":"QuestionRef","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"f7ce8046-c2e9-3ab7-9bce-4b5f209f9a72","title":"哈希表搜索复杂度","question_id":3229,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":7,"resolved":{"question_id":3229,"title":"哈希表搜索复杂度","description":"","description_en":"","knowledges":[],"question_type":"single_choice","question_text":"在哈希表中搜索的最坏情况时间复杂度是多少？","question_text_html":"<p>在哈希表中搜索的最坏情况时间复杂度是多少？</p>\n","question_options":[{"id":11341,"key":"A","text":"O(1)","text_html":"<p>O(1)</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"哈希表搜索速度很快，即使在最糟糕的情况下也几乎是恒定时间。","md_html":"<p>哈希表搜索速度很快，即使在最糟糕的情况下也几乎是恒定时间。</p>\n"},"correct":true,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":11342,"key":"B","text":"O(log n)","text_html":"<p>O(log n)</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"哈希表搜索本质上不是对数运算。","md_html":"<p>哈希表搜索本质上不是对数运算。</p>\n"},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":11343,"key":"C","text":"O(n)","text_html":"<p>O(n)</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"即使在最糟糕的情况下，哈希表搜索的速度一般也比线性时间快。","md_html":"<p>即使在最糟糕的情况下，哈希表搜索的速度一般也比线性时间快。</p>\n"},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":11344,"key":"D","text":"O(n^2)","text_html":"<p>O(n^2)</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"哈希表搜索不是二次运算，每次查找时间恒定","md_html":"<p>哈希表搜索不是二次运算，每次查找时间恒定</p>\n"},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}}],"user_answers":null,"is_right":null}},{"type":"QuestionRef","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"54d7f9ab-9da7-3bb7-b1b4-450d16d47d35","title":"哈希表与数组","question_id":3230,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":8,"resolved":{"question_id":3230,"title":"哈希表与数组","description":"","description_en":"","knowledges":[],"question_type":"single_choice","question_text":"哈希表和数组有什么区别？","question_text_html":"<p>哈希表和数组有什么区别？</p>\n","question_options":[{"id":11345,"key":"A","text":"哈希表允许重复数据，而数组不允许。","text_html":"<p>哈希表允许重复数据，而数组不允许。</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"哈希表和数组都可能包含重复数据。","md_html":"<p>哈希表和数组都可能包含重复数据。</p>\n"},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":11346,"key":"B","text":"哈希表使用键来映射值，而数组使用索引。","text_html":"<p>哈希表使用键来映射值，而数组使用索引。</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"哈希表使用键来映射值，而数组使用索引。","md_html":"<p>哈希表使用键来映射值，而数组使用索引。</p>\n"},"correct":true,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":11347,"key":"C","text":"哈希表总是排序的，而数组不是。","text_html":"<p>哈希表总是排序的，而数组不是。</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"哈希表和数组本身都没有排序。","md_html":"<p>哈希表和数组本身都没有排序。</p>\n"},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":11348,"key":"D","text":"哈希表的大小是固定的，而数组的大小是动态的。","text_html":"<p>哈希表的大小是固定的，而数组的大小是动态的。</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"哈希表也可以动态调整大小。","md_html":"<p>哈希表也可以动态调整大小。</p>\n"},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}}],"user_answers":null,"is_right":null}}],"status":"undo","course_no":"035","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/api/course/035/page/1579"}
